# Every secret the platform needs. Values live in ~/.config/ai-native-sdlc/secrets.env,
# never in this repository.
#
# kind:      generated  the bootstrap creates a random value when it is missing
#            external   issued elsewhere; the operator puts it into secrets.env
# required:  yes | no   preflight fails when a required external value is missing
# namespace, secret, key: where the bootstrap puts the value in the cluster
#
# name                kind      required  namespace  secret       key
PLANE_ADMIN_EMAIL     external  yes       plane      plane-admin  email
